{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"You seek validation from those who cannot give it. You have been looking in the wrong places for a very long time. What you need has always been inside you.","quote1":"If I know what love is, it is because of you.  ","quote2":"Happiness is a perfume you cannot pour on others without getting a few drops on yourself.  ","quote3":"Be faithful in small things because it is in them that your strength lies.   ","_id":"K1g7dSxoVohJLC9n"}
